{"actions":[{"actionCode":"H11100","actionDate":"2025-01-13","source":"House floor actions","text":"Referred to the House Committee on Ways and Means.","type":"IntroReferral"},{"actionCode":"Intro-H","actionDate":"2025-01-13","source":"Library of Congress","text":"Introduced in House","type":"IntroReferral"},{"actionCode":"1000","actionDate":"2025-01-13","source":"Library of Congress","text":"Introduced in House","type":"IntroReferral"}],"congress":119,"congressGovUrl":"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/332","cosponsors":[{"bioguideId":"T000468","fullName":"Rep. Titus, Dina [D-NV-1]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-01-13","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NV"},{"bioguideId":"F000446","fullName":"Rep. Feenstra, Randy [R-IA-4]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-01-16","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"IA"},{"bioguideId":"B001307","fullName":"Rep. Baird, James R. [R-IN-4]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-01-16","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"IN"},{"bioguideId":"T000478","fullName":"Rep. Tenney, Claudia [R-NY-24]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-01-16","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NY"},{"bioguideId":"K000376","fullName":"Rep. Kelly, Mike [R-PA-16]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-01-21","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"PA"},{"bioguideId":"B001306","fullName":"Rep. Balderson, Troy [R-OH-12]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-01-21","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"OH"},{"bioguideId":"H001093","fullName":"Rep. Houchin, Erin [R-IN-9]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-01-21","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"IN"},{"bioguideId":"M001205","fullName":"Rep. Miller, Carol D. [R-WV-1]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-01-31","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"WV"},{"bioguideId":"S001214","fullName":"Rep. Steube, W. Gregory [R-FL-17]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-04","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"FL"},{"bioguideId":"B001260","fullName":"Rep. Buchanan, Vern [R-FL-16]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-24","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"FL"},{"bioguideId":"C001126","fullName":"Rep. Carey, Mike [R-OH-15]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-03-18","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"OH"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T18:57:37+00:00","id":"hr332-119","introducedDate":"2025-01-13","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-01-13","text":"Referred to the House Committee on Ways and Means."},"laws":[],"number":"332","originChamber":"House","policyArea":"Taxation","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"Y000067","district":2,"fullName":"Rep. Yakym, Rudy [R-IN-2]","party":"R","state":"IN"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-01-13","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><strong>Travel Trailer and Camper Tax Parity Act</strong></p><p>This bill expands the exclusion of interest on floor plan financing from the limit on the tax deduction for&nbsp;business interest expenses to include interest on floor plan financing of certain non-motorized, towable campers and trailers.&nbsp;</p><p>Under current law, the tax deduction for business interest expenses is generally limited to 30% of adjusted taxable income. (Some exceptions apply.) However, under current law, interest on floor plan financing (financing used to acquire inventory for sale or lease) of motorized vehicles (e.g., self-propelled vehicles designed to transport people) is excluded from the limit on the tax deduction for business interest expenses.</p><p>Under the bill, the exclusion of interest on floor plan financing from the limit on the tax deduction for business interest expenses is expanded to include interest on floor plan financing of any camper or trailer designed to (1) provide temporary living quarters for recreational, camping, or seasonal use; and (2) be towed by, or affixed to, a motor vehicle.&nbsp;</p>","updateDate":"2025-04-16T18:28:30Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Travel Trailer and Camper Tax Parity Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2025-12-05T21:39:20Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2025-12-05T21:39:20Z"}
